        <obo:IAO_0000115>A member of the class of 7-hydroxyisoflavones that is 7-hydroxyisoflavone which is substituted by an additional hydroxy group at position 5 and a methoxy group at position 4&apos;. A phytoestrogen, it has putative benefits in dietary cancer prophylaxis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
