        <obo:IAO_0000115>An epoxycarotenol that is 5,5&apos;,6,6&apos;-tetrahydro-5,6:5&apos;,6&apos;-diepoxy-β,β-carotene substituted by hydroxy groups at positions 3 and 3&apos;. It is the naturally occurring xanthophyll pigment found in a variety of plants.</obo:IAO_0000115>
