        <obo:IAO_0000115>A &lt;em&gt;N&lt;/em&gt;-acylpiperidine that is piperidine substituted by a (1&lt;i&gt;E&lt;/i&gt;,3&lt;i&gt;E&lt;/i&gt;)-1-(1,3-benzodioxol-5-yl)-5-oxopenta-1,3-dien-5-yl group at the nitrogen atom. It is an alkaloid isolated from the plant &lt;em&gt;Piper nigrum&lt;/em&gt;.</obo:IAO_0000115>
