        <obo:IAO_0000115>A retinal in which the double bond α- to the aldehyde group has &lt;i&gt;cis&lt;/i&gt; configuration, whilst the remaining acyclic double bonds have &lt;i&gt;trans&lt;/i&gt; configuration.</obo:IAO_0000115>
