        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_36615"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A limonoid with formula C&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;28&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;H&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;34&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;O&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;9&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;. It is commonly found in edible citrus fruits including lemons, limes, oranges, and grapefruits. The compound exhibits a variety of biological and pharmacological activities including anticancer, antiinflammatory, antiobesity, and antiviral.</obo:IAO_0000115>
